    {
      "id": "AL-8",
      "text": "The merged return flows carry no condition, so empCancel and SubconCancel are set but never read: of the 3 cancel paths D03 ¶225 counts, only allocationCancel is routed. Cancelling the employee search is documented as returning without selection (D04 ¶251); for the subcontractor search D04 ¶265 says only that the flag is set. Nothing in the process enforces either."
