    {
      "id": "AL-9",
      "text": "Write contents are only partly documented. D03 ¶126 lists updatedBy and updatedOn among the fields of each written employee record, but the screen initialises only employee, project, createdBy, createdOn and isActive (D03 ¶140–145), D05 ¶343–344 sets updatedBy/updatedOn on record update, and D02 ¶287 says all four audit fields are captured at allocation time. The list written is existing rows merged with new ones (D03 ¶146), so the write is an upsert; whether soft-deleted rows reach it is not stated. Nothing is documented for the subcontractor records beyond D03 ¶130. Both lists default to null (D03 ¶64–65) and both writes are unconditional."
